1. Online Qiuz Timer

Initialize Array timeSlots of size N  // N = number of questions
Initialize Integer currentIndex = 0

Function assignTimeSlots():
    For i from 0 to N-1:
        timeSlots[i] = defaultTimePerQuestion

Function startQuiz():
    While quiz is active:
        currentTime = timeSlots[currentIndex]
        If currentTime <= warningThreshold:
            Trigger warning for current question
        Wait for 1 second
        Decrement timeSlots[currentIndex]
        If timeSlots[currentIndex] == 0:
            Move to next question
            currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) mod N

2. Job Scheduler

Class Job:
    Attributes:
        jobId
        deadline
        processingTime

    Method getPriority():
        Return deadline - processingTime  // Lower value = higher urgency

Initialize PriorityQueue<Job> jobQueue
    // Priority based on getPriority()

Function addJob(job):
    Insert job into jobQueue

Function processJobs():
    While jobQueue is not empty:
        job = jobQueue.poll()  // Get job with highest priority
        Execute job
        Log job completion
